// Generated by tools/build_y10_2_2_l4_drills.mjs: edit that, then run it. What a check digit is for, the two methods
// from the 0478 papers (Method 1: add the digits, remainder after dividing by 10; Method 2: digit x position, MOD 11,
// 10 is X), accept or reject, and choosing between a check digit and the transmission checks. Every card has a
